---
Delegate a self-contained subtask to a fresh agent and get its final answer back.
---

The subagent starts with no context: include everything it needs in the task
(paths, goals, constraints, expected output). Use it for exploratory or
parallelisable work so large intermediate output stays out of this conversation.
subagent blocks until done; subagent_async returns immediately and you are
notified with the result when it completes.
